      "answer": {
        "lead": "No, it's not too late. Your enrollment window runs through 2026-11-11, and your Medical PPO, Dental, Vision and 401(k) elections are still pending.",
        "policy_facts": [
          {
            "text": "New hires have 30 calendar days from their hire date to enrol. Your hire date is 2026-10-12, so your window closes on 2026-11-11.",
            "citations": [
