                "tool": "lookup_benefits_status"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Your records show Medical PPO, Dental, Vision and 401(k) as \"pending\" (employee-only coverage level, effective 2026-11-01). Life is already enrolled.",
            "citations": [],
            "data_sources": [
              {
                "tool": "lookup_benefits_status"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "If you enrol within your window, coverage is back-dated to the first day of the month after your hire date. Until you enrol, you have no Ridgeline coverage.",
            "citations": [
              {
                "doc_id": "RSE-BEN-01",
                "section": "1.2",
                "snippet": "Until you enrol, you have no Ridgeline coverage, so enrol early in your window."
              }
            ],
            "data_sources": []
          },
          {
            "text": "HR cannot extend the new-hire window. If you miss it, you can next enrol at open enrollment, unless you have a qualifying life event before then.",
            "citations": [
              {
                "doc_id": "RSE-BEN-01",
                "section": "3.2",
                "snippet": "HR cannot extend the new-hire window, so missing it can leave you without Ridgeline coverage until the next plan year."
              }
            ],
            "data_sources": []
          }
        ],
        "recommendations": [
          {
            "text": "Enrol in the HR Portal under Benefits as soon as you can. Don't wait until the last week. Choose your plans and coverage levels, add any family members, and confirm."
          },
          {
            "text": "If you're unsure what to choose, enrol in a plan now. You can change your choices at open enrollment."
          },
          {
            "text": "A draft message to your manager is showing on a Confirm card. I created it by mistake, and it has placeholder text. Please don't confirm it. Cancel it, and nothing will change."
